{"title": "名词录", "index": 1229, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\" id=\"PTM9C0-8026e167373a4615932608960548c905\">\n<div class=\"chapter\" id=\"chapter\">\n<h1 class=\"kindle-cn-heading18\" id=\"calibre_pb_0\">名词录</h1>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Nietzsche：尼采</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Dionysus：狄俄尼索斯</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Hegel：黑格尔</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Copernicus：哥白尼</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Goethe：歌德</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Wagner：瓦格纳</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-italic\">Nibelungen</span>：《尼伯龙根指环》</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Nihilism：虚无主义</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Perspectivism：透视主义</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Mechanistic：机械论</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Spinozism：斯宾诺莎主义</p><a class=\"calibre17\" id=\"pg663\"></a>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Positivistic：实证主义</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Anarchism：无政府主义</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Egoism：利己主义</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Pessimism：悲观主义</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Schopenhauer：叔本华</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Kant：康德</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Claude Bernard：克洛德·贝尔纳</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Pascal：帕斯卡尔</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Pascalism：帕斯卡尔思想</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Fatalism：宿命论</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Darwinism：达尔文主义</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Fromentin：弗罗芒坦</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Walter Scott：沃尔特·司各特</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Magny：马格尼</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Tolstoy：托尔斯泰</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Dostoevsky：陀思妥耶夫斯基</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Henrik Ibsen：亨利克·易卜生</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-italic\">Parsifal</span>：《帕西法尔》</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Bismarck：俾斯麦</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Voltaire：伏尔泰</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Galiani：伽里阿尼</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Leopardi：莱奥帕蒂</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-italic\">Birth of Tragedy</span>：《悲剧的诞生》</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Hume：休谟</p><a class=\"calibre17\" id=\"pg664\"></a>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Swedenborg：斯维登堡</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">La Rochefoucauld：拉罗什富科</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Rousseau：卢梭</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Mrs.Beecher-Stowe：比彻-斯托夫人</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Baudelaire：波德莱尔</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Descartes：笛卡儿</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Auguste Comte：奥古斯都·孔德</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Port-Royal：波尔特-鲁雅（地名）</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Alfieri：阿尔弗利</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Geneva：日内瓦</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Byron：拜伦</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Venice：威尼斯</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Locke：洛克</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Leibniz：莱布尼茨</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Chateaubriand：夏多布里昂</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Delacroix：德拉克罗瓦</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Theoph Gautier：戈蒂耶</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Victor Hugo：维克多·雨果</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Shakespeare：莎士比亚</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">George Sand：乔治桑</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Lamartine：拉瓦丁</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Sorrent：索伦托</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Posilipp：波西利帕</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Spain：西班牙</p><a class=\"calibre17\" id=\"pg665\"></a>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Napoleon：拿破仑</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Delacroix Ingres：德拉克罗瓦·安格尔</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Gluck：格鲁克</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Haydn：海顿</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Beethoven：贝多芬</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Mozart