2\">Taine：泰纳</p><a class=\"calibre17\" id=\"pg668\"></a>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Lessing：莱辛</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Tartuffes：答尔丢夫</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Grote：格罗特</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Pyrrho：皮洛</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Aristippus：亚里斯提卜</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Megarian：迈加拉，地名</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Goncourts：龚古尔兄弟</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Diogenes：第欧根尼</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Auguste Comte：奥古斯都·孔德</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Bacon：培根</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Odysseus：奥德修斯</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Leopardi：莱奥帕尔迪</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Apollinian：阿波罗</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Faustian：浮士德式</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Gautier：戈蒂埃</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Flaubert：福楼拜</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Winckelmann：温克尔曼</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Offenbach：奥芬巴赫</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Heinrich Schutz：海因里希·舒茨</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Rahel：瑞海尔</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Liszt：李斯特</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Lohengrin：罗英格林</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Zola：左拉</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Herrnhuteristic：摩拉维亚教派</p><a class=\"calibre17\" id=\"pg669\"></a>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Manzoni：曼佐尼</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\"><span class=\"kindle-cn-italic\">Conte di Carmagnoia</span>：《卡尔曼格诺拉伯爵》</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Dante：但丁</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Michelangelo：米开朗琪罗</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Henri Fred：亨利·弗雷德</p>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-para-left2\">Amiel：埃米尔</p><a class=\"calibre17\" id=\"pg670\"></a>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}